                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🏁</div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Head-to-Head Racing</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Two rigs side by side. Your guests compete for fastest lap. Leaderboard keeps the competition alive all night.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
